## Add printable Evaluate business-insights report
================================================================================

Context: After Ask both, the insights pane was a short analysis only. Users
needed a full summary they can open in a modal and export as PDF: hypothetical
facts, Compare overlay, both answers, then the agent narrative.

Changes:

1. src/front/templates/partials/simulation/_sim_insights_report_modal.html
   Bootstrap xl modal with Close and Export PDF (print).
2. src/front/templates/partials/simulation/_sim_compare.html
   Open report button next to the insights title (disabled until insights
   succeed).
3. src/front/templates/simulation.html
   Include the report modal.
4. src/front/static/simulation/js/simulation-evaluate.js
   Compose the report from GET /simulation/{id}, SimulationCompare.data /
   canvas snapshot, stored answers, and the agent Markdown. Export PDF calls
   window.print() with a print class on html.
5. src/front/static/simulation/css/simulation.css
   Report layout and @media print rules that isolate the modal.
6. tests/units/front/test_simulation_page_contract.py
   Modal include, Open report, print, and composed sections.
7. docs/user-guide.md
   Evaluate tab and printable report.

