Context: The second banner (L2 domain subnav under the top navbar) was heavy:
numbered 1-5 workspace "steps", a filled primary domain badge, a separate
Versions button, and a Save button with no unsaved-state signal. Redesigned
to the approved "C" direction (breadcrumb switcher + quiet segmented tabs).
The L1 top navbar is unchanged. Specs: docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-06-l2-subnav-modern-restyle-design.md
and docs/superpowers/plans/2026-11-06-l2-subnav-modern-restyle.md (both local,
gitignored).

Changes:

1. src/front/templates/base.html
   Domain crumb (`#domainContextTrigger`, `.ob-subnav-crumb`) with caret; version
   crumb (`.ob-subnav-version-crumb`, `#menuSwitchDomain` from menu_config) showing
   `vN ▾`, so Versions is merged into the version crumb. Workspace ordinals 1-5
   removed. Separate right-side Versions button removed. Close is a ghost action.
   Save gets a dirty dot (`.ob-subnav-save-dirty`) and a shortcut keycap
   (`.ob-subnav-save-kbd`).
2. src/front/static/global/css/main.css
   Removed the superseded L2 rules (domain badge, ordinals, gradient active tab,
   outlined Versions/Close/Save). Added the crumb, grey workspace track, raised
   active chip, Save dirty/keycap, and ghost Close rules. Mobile and constrained
   media blocks updated to the new selectors.
3. src/front/static/global/js/navbar.js
   Dirty bus: `setDomainDirty(source, dirty)` and `clearAllDomainDirty()`
   (exposed on window); `.is-dirty` toggled on Save; cleared after a successful
   domain save. Platform-aware shortcut label (⌘S / Ctrl+S).
4. src/front/static/global/js/ontology-design.js
   Publishes ontology registry-dirty state to the bus (guarded calls).
5. src/front/static/global/js/mapping-core.js
   Publishes mapping registry-dirty state to the bus (guarded calls).
6. tests/units/front/test_segmented_subnav_contract.py
   Contract updated to the C direction (crumbs, track, Save dirty/keycap, no
   ordinals).
7. tests/units/front/test_mobile_subnav_contract.py
   Visible-label count updated (Versions is now the vN crumb).
8. tests/units/front/test_clarity_design_contract.py
   Active workspace contract: surface chip instead of gradient.
9. tests/units/front/test_subnav_dirty_contract.py (new)
   Contract for the dirty bus, publishers, and shortcut label.
10. .cursor/11-frontend-design.mdc
    L2 contract rewritten (layout list, action styles, mobile, tokens).
11. docs/user-guide.md, docs/architecture.md
    Version switch, Save dirty dot, and L2 description updated.

Decisions and deviations from the approved spec:
- Keyboard shortcut: Ctrl/Cmd+S was already handled globally in
  base-ui-handlers.js (including inside inputs). No second handler was added,
  to avoid a double save. The on-button keycap label is the only new piece.
- Version switcher: kept the existing "Switch Version" modal (it already has the
  New Version action in its footer) instead of rebuilding it as an anchored
  dropdown. Converting it to an anchored dropdown is a possible follow-up.

